      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for starting an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login, I need to choose a concrete external provider and use its identifiable code. I will use Google as the provider for this task. The code will import the necessary Google-specific libraries and use Google's OAuth2 client ID and secret. </thinking>\n",
